  "description": "**Superseded — not the recommended data.** For current work use [`trazo3-fields`](../../trazo3-fields/). Field boundaries from the TrazoSA model, shared through the Early Adopters Program in late 2025. Eight regions across Argentina, Brazil and Paraguay. TrazoSA excludes the global Fields of The World baseline, training only on South American data, and is the most conservative model. **This is the only published output of TrazoSA anywhere in this catalog.**",
